      "side": 1,
      "message": "What flags are you worried about?  Adding a new property for every kotlinc flag isn\u0027t going to scale well.  For cc_* modules we have checks to explicitly error on flags we don\u0027t want passed by the Android.bp files (https://android.googlesource.com/platform/build/soong/+/master/cc/check.go)",
      "revId": "4ed1659ed0bede8dd77850c80b7db17d8c3614a9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
