      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a little worried about this given the non-final nature of the coroutine apis.  Encouraging using them will make it hard to update the kotlin version later if the api has changed - every user would need to be fixed.",
      "revId": "4ed1659ed0bede8dd77850c80b7db17d8c3614a9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
