      "writtenOn": "2018-08-21T17:48:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe we should take advantage of the low amount of kotlin code to add -Werror to the default flags, and then let modules disable any warnings they don\u0027t want to fix?",
      "revId": "4ed1659ed0bede8dd77850c80b7db17d8c3614a9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
